<title>ZIMBABWE: TABLE - BICCCAFCA H1 shr up, no div.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BICCCAFCA H1 shr up, no div.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		(million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr loss (cts)		 1.6	   vs     1.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			  0.1 gain    vs     0.4 loss</p>
<p>    Tax				0.6	   vs     nil</p>
<p>    Pre-interest profit	  2.8	   vs     0.8</p>
<p>    Interest paid		  2.7	   vs     1.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		     124.9	   vs     96.9</p>
<p>Full Name: BICCCAFCA Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said there would be no interim dividend while it consolidated its position. It said the outlook was promising as demand for products continued to strengthen although domestic copper supplies remained unreliable.</p>
<p>--Harare Newsroom: 263-4 72 52 27/8/9--</p>
</text>
